## Classic Red Christmas Nail Colors

Red or green is a false choice. Both work, and the one that fits depends entirely on the room you are walking into. A cream, blue-based red carries the most classic Christmas signal of any color on this list, and it earns that reputation honestly.

Candy apple red, the brightest and glossiest of the family, suits parties and events where a little drama is welcome. A deeper cardinal red with a matte topcoat pulls the same color into quieter territory, appropriate for the office or a low-key dinner. Cherry red sits between the two, warm rather than icy, and it photographs well against nearly every skin tone.

The mistake most readers make with red is picking the finish before the occasion. Match the shine level to the room first. A cream red at an office party reads polished. A high-gloss red at the same event can tip into costume territory. <a href='/blog/christmas-nails/red-christmas-nails' style='color: inherit'>Red christmas nails</a> covers deeper inspiration if this is your family.

