## The Shade That's Actually Yours

Red and green were never the only correct answer, and by this point that should feel obvious rather than radical. The right **christmas nail colors** choice was never about picking the most traditional shade available. It was about picking the one that actually fits your event, your nails, and the version of festive you want to show up as this year.

If a color on this list stopped you, burgundy, champagne gold, icy blue, or a dusty pink you weren't expecting to consider, that instinct is worth trusting. None of these shades need defending. A cream red at an office party, a chrome gold on New Year's Eve, a plum that carries through both: each one earns its place the same way, by matching the room it walks into.

Pick the shade. Book the appointment. It was already Christmas enough.
